 <i class="ti ti-heart"></i><span>Wishlist</span>
 <span class="badge wish-badge">0</span>
 </a>
 <a href="/cart" class="nav-btn nav-cart-btn">
 <i class="ti ti-shopping-cart"></i><span>Cart</span>
 <span class="badge cart-badge">0</span>
 </a>
 <a href="/account" class="nav-btn" id="nav-account-btn"><i class="ti ti-user"></i><span id="nav-account-label">Login / Register</span></a>
 <a href="/track" class="nav-btn" id="nav-track-btn"><i class="ti ti-truck-delivery"></i><span>Track</span></a>
 </div>
 </div>
</nav>

<div class="track-wrap">
  <div class="track-grid">
    <div class="trk-card">
      <div class="trk-head">
        <h1 class="trk-title"><i class="ti ti-truck-delivery"></i> Track your order</h1>
        <p class="trk-sub">Enter your Order ID (example: <b>RKS-2026-12345678</b>) to see status and details.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trk-body">
        <form class="trk-form" id="trk-form" onsubmit="return false;">
          <div class="trk-input-wrap">
            <i class="ti ti-receipt"></i>
            <input class="trk-input" id="trk-order-id" type="text" placeholder="RKS-2026-........" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="trk-btn" id="trk-submit"><i class="ti ti-search"></i> Track</button>
        </form>
        <div class="trk-hint">Tip: Order ID আপনার Success page‑এ “Order ID” এর পাশে থাকে।</div>
        <div class="trk-result" id="trk-result" hidden></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="trk-card">
      <div class="trk-head">
        <h2 class="trk-title"><i class="ti ti-info-circle"></i> How it works</h2>
        <p class="trk-sub">Order ID দিয়ে track করলে আপনি status, items এবং total দেখতে পারবেন।</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trk-body">
        <div class="trk-step"><i class="ti ti-receipt"></i><div><b>1) Copy Order ID</b><span>Success page থেকে Order ID কপি করুন (RKS‑2026‑...).</span></div></div>
        <div class="trk-step"><i class="ti ti-search"></i><div><b>2) Paste & Track</b><span>এই পেজে paste করে “Track” চাপুন।</span></div></div>
        <div class="trk-step"><i class="ti ti-package"></i><div><b>3) View status</b><span>Pending/Confirmed/Shipped/Delivered status দেখুন।</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="footer" id="global-footer">
 <div class="footer-inner">
 <div class="footer-grid">
 <div><a href="/" class="footer-logo site-logo-link" aria-label="RakuShopBD — Home">
  <img src="/images/rakushopbd-logo.png" alt="RakuShopBD" class="site-logo-img site-logo-img--footer" width="300" height="76">
 </a>
